{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c8f1503c-7e11-807b-b3a2-f5080a783934",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T14:14:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nancy Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:09:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. Is it all right if I ask about a shutoff notice? I got a warning in the mail about my water and sewer bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:10:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Do you have the notice in front of you? It should list an account number and a date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:10:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, yes. Is it all right if I read the account number to you? It's, um, four four one, seven, zero two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Let me pull that up. And could I have the name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:10:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nancy Burdick. B-U-R-D-I-C-K. I rent, but the water bill comes to me, which is a whole other thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:10:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I have it. Ms. Burdick, I see a past-due balance, and the notice shows a shutoff date of the ninth of January."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The ninth. So that's, what, about ten days. That's not much. Is it all right if I ask if that's a firm date, or is there any wiggle room?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:11:02-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The date on the notice is the date to plan around. If the balance is paid before then, the shutoff doesn't go forward. If you can't pay it all, you can call back and ask about arrangements, but I'd do that before the ninth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:11:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I just wish they'd tell you these things sooner. I only opened that envelope yesterday because it was under a pile."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:11:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Would you like me to go over the balance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:11:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. And, is it all right if I ask for a copy of the bill emailed to me? The paper one has a coffee ring on it and I can barely read the bottom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:11:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can send a duplicate. What email address would you like it sent to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:11:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Um, it's nancy dot burdick fifty-eight, at a mail dot com. Spelled out, B-U-R-D-I-C-K."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:12:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. Nancy dot burdick fifty-eight, at a mail dot com."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:12:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:12:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've sent it. It should arrive within a few minutes. The total due is on the first page, and it includes the current charges plus the earlier balance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:12:20-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Now, here's my problem. I want to get it paid before the weekend. Is it all right if I ask how I'd do that once your office is closed? I work until five and I won't make it down there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:12:36-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There are a few ways. You can pay online through the city's payment page, any hour. There's also a drop box at City Hall for checks, and it's available after we close. Just write your account number on the check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:12:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A drop box. Is that outside, by the door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:12:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's outside the main entrance. Checks only, not cash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the online one, do I need anything besides the account number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:13:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the account number and a card or bank account information. The emailed bill will have the details you need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll look at it tonight, then. It's annoying, honestly. I'd have paid it right away if I'd known."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:13:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about the timing. Once you pay, the payment should post within a day or two, and that stops the shutoff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:13:32-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Oh, one more thing, and this is silly. Is it all right if I mention something? A neighbor left a note on my door this morning. I haven't read it yet, it's still sitting on the table. I hope it's not about the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:13:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It may be unrelated. If it does turn out to be about the account, call us back and we can look at it together."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:14:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you. Is it all right if I ask your name again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:14:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's Priya."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:14:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Priya. Happy New Year, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:14:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same to you, Ms. Burdick. Take care."
    }
  ],
